# Attempt 2: Problems and Fixes

> Written from memory and cross-checked against my own notes. Some causes and
> fixes may still be incomplete.

Unlike my first attempt with Omarchy, I didn't encounter any significant
problems during the Fedora installation itself. Most of the difficulties I
experienced came later, while actually using Fedora, particularly when I was
unfamiliar with certain terminal commands for installing software, editing
configurations, and exploring the system in general.

